window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>My wife. I love saying those words. She's mine, and if she thinks I'm going to let her run without tracking her down and bringing her back to where she belongs - with me - then she's about to be introduced to a new reality. Because I'll fight dirty to give her the happily ever after she deserves. </p> <p><i>Dirty Together</i> is the final book in the Dirty Billionaire Trilogy. </p>"; 
